new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6908e70
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CODING_STANDARDS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Coding standards
+
+Four rules of judgement. No tool checks them: the review does. Each one comes from a defect that
+the audit of 2026-11-25 found more than once (`docs/audit/RAPPORT.md`, section 9).
+
+| Rule | In the code |
+|---|---|
+| A comment gives the rule and its evidence (`file:line`), never the story of the bug. The story goes into `CHANGELOG.md`. | — |
+| A packet names a recipe by its identity and a machine by its position in the world, never by a list index. | `RecipeWriter.resolve` |
+| A gesture that removes or deletes asks for a second click, and never answers a right click alone. A gesture that adds needs no second click. | `SecondClick` |
+| A write always decides on a fresh scan. A cache serves the display only. | `ContainerPatEditor.scannedGroup` |
